Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:28.61,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}I cannot believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.61,0:02:30.81,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}The world I used to know is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.01,0:02:36.01,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}I just woke up one day and everything changed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:41.01,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Zetsubou risou
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:45.81,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Yudanerare majiwaru sekai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:47.81,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Are you excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:52.81,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Netsu obiru toiki jouki suru hoho
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:57.41,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Shisen no saki de kimi ga warau
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.71,0:03:01.41,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Namida ukabetemo sakendemo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.41,0:03:03.71,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Tomaranai shoudou
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.61,0:03:11.01,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Nigirishimeta yakusoku hanasanaide kimi wo kanjiru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.51,0:03:16.81,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Tsuranuite miseru yo kakujitsu na toko made
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.81,0:03:21.91,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Daremo shiranai michi no ryouiki nara oshihiraite
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:27.61,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&H1181F1&}Omoidasu yo tsuyoku mabushii hitomi wo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:33.31,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Daremo yaranai nara jibun de yaru shika nai
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.31,0:03:37.01,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Just gotta do it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:28.61,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Eu não posso acreditar nisso!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.61,0:02:30.81,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}O mundo que eu conhecia já não existe mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.01,0:02:36.01,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Um dia acordei e tudo mudou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:41.01,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Desespero, ideais...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:45.81,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}e um mundo entrelaçado que foi confiado a mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:47.81,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Você está animado?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:52.81,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Sua respiração está quente, suas bochechas estão coradas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:57.41,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Vejo você rindo em meus olhos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.71,0:03:01.41,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Mesmo se você chorar ou gritar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.41,0:03:03.71,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Não tem como parar este impulso.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.61,0:03:11.01,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Não deixe de lado a sua promessa, eu sinto sua presença.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.51,0:03:16.81,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Vou continuar até ter certeza.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.81,0:03:21.91,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Se é um território desconhecido, eu o abrirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:27.61,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&H1181F1&}Lembrarei desses olhos fortes e deslumbrantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:33.31,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Se ninguém o faz, eu mesmo tenho que fazê-lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.31,0:03:37.01,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Só tem que ser feito.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,SekkonSigns,,0,0,0,,
